                                                "sense_id": "56aed346-ed7f-347d-8af6-7714d743973b",
                                                "text": "Commencing next summer, 30,000 tonnes of cliff face will be removed, and mesh-and-bolt caging installed on a three-mile section to stabilise the surface and prevent rock falls."
